sionId":"l2-replay-20261104-124307-tmj1"},{"t":1793776429396,"lane":"1","type":"agent.usage","inputTokens":72358,"outputTokens":80,"cachedTokens":63715,"turns":8},{"t":1793776429407,"lane":"1","type":"agent.say","text":"The ferry is booked and paid. You approved it on the yes card, and the payment then went through.\n\n- **Booking reference:** HL-32BGAM\n- **Trip:** Saturday 7 November. Leaves the Gateway of India at 09:30 and reaches Elephanta at 10:30. The return boat leaves Elephanta at 14:00 and gets back at 15:00.\n- **Seats:** Upper deck, 3.20 USDC a person. Asha Rao has U39, Leo Marin U40, Mei Tan U41 and Sam Okoye U42.\n- **Boarding:** Gateway jetty 4, which has step-free access and a ramp to the boat. Help boarding is on the booking for Sam's cane, at no charge.\n- **Paid:** 12.80 USDC (about 1,126 INR) on the Arbitrum Sepolia test network. Transaction: `0x1fbfa1d6\u2026921579360`\n- **Cancellation:** free until Friday 6 November at 18:00. The refund goes back to the same wallet.\n\nSome notes:\n- **Departure time:** 09:30 was the only time between 9 and 10 with upper-deck seats left. The 09:00 boat's upper deck was sold out, and the 10:00 boat had only 2 upper-deck seats.\n- **Return time:** I took \"back after 14:00\" to mean the 14:00 boat back. If you meant one leaving later than 14:00, the 15:30 boat still has upper-deck seats at the same price. I'd have to cancel this booking and book again (cancellation is free until Friday 18:00).\n- **Unused quote:** I made a first quote and replaced it with a second one only to reword the request for boarding help. No order was made from the first one."},{"t":1793776429420,"lane":"1","type":"agent.usage","inputTokens":72358,"outputTokens":2209,"cachedTokens":63715,"turns":8,"costUsd":0.126003},{"t":1793776429420,"lane":"1","type":"agent.done","ok":true,"ms":39554,"turns":8,"result":"The ferry is booked and paid. You approved it on the yes card, and the payment then went through.\n\n- **Booking reference:** HL-32BG